# netlab writes this file to /etc/ze/bgp.ignore and nothing reads it.
#
# Ze has no include directive, so ze/ze.j2 renders the bgp configuration into
# /etc/ze/ze.conf with the rest of the running configuration. This stub exists
# because netlab needs one configuration template per declared module: without
# it, `netlab create` fails with "Cannot find bgp configuration template".
